---
import { BIT_GROUPS } from "../lib/meta";
---
<p class="bits-legend">
  <span class="bits" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="bit on"></span>
    <span class="bit"></span>
  </span>
  Each tick is a PoolManager permission bit encoded in the hook address. Lit means that callback runs.
  <span class="bits-groups">{BIT_GROUPS.map((g) => g.label).join(" · ")}</span>
</p>
